# slave_to_iced
! Readable view; authoritative fields are in ../locations.json.
! JO9 MOD START J9M2887 | 2026-10-10_restore_private_room_ui | changed block; context may be included
if snk_room_target > 0 and $curloc = 'slave_to_iced': gs 'snk_room_bridge', 'guard', 'slave_to_iced'
! JO9 MOD END J9M2887
!move slave to a cryo cell with replacement (call with gosub, not goto)

dynamic $swap_slave_instances, 'slave', 'iced_<<args[0]>>'

if slave_state > CONST_INT['no_slave']: easy_for_slave = 1 & dynamic $slave_energy_drop &! decanting from cryo costs slave half an energy star - ImperatorAugustus

------------ slave_to_iced ------------
